<title>USA: Gabelli group cuts DeSoto Inc stake.</title>
<headline>Gabelli group cuts DeSoto Inc stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Monday it had cut its stake in DeSoto Inc to 450,600 common shares, or 9.91 percent of the total outstanding, from 10.95 percent held on July 11.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 33,000 shares between July 21 and August 21 at prices ranging from $5.5038 to $6 per share.</p>
